/E (The Philippine Statistics Authority is the main curator and database for all kinds of personal and legal documents for the Filipino citizen. And along the way, many errors and misaligned information may appear on curated documents ranging from misspellings, inconsistent dates, and information that is not properly updated. These issues, no matter how scarce they may be, have served as issues for the Filipino citizen as well as for the compilation and storage of documents by the PSA. Which is why the PSA )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
